	<entry>
		<title type="html"><![CDATA[Réponse à&#160;:  recherche multi champs]]></title>
		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=6896#p6896"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Non, je pense que ce qui est attendu c&#039;est plutôt :</p><p>select * from (select * from ma_table inner join ma_2eme_table <br />on&#160; ma_table.id_ext = ma_2eme_table.id ) as tmp<br />WHERE <br />tmp::text ~ &#039;ma_chaine_a_rechercher&#039;</p>]]></content>
